# LF everywhere in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# Without this, Git's autocrlf checks these files out with CRLF on Windows while
# every generator in tools/ writes LF, so a rebuild that changed nothing still
# shows as modified. That cost a real diagnosis: version.json looked unstable
# across rebuilds when its content was byte-identical and only the line endings
# differed.
#
# It also matters for what ships. dist/ is committed and served to phones, and
# tools/build_app.py compares index.html against src/ — a checkout that rewrote
# the endings would make --check fail for a reason that has nothing to do with
# the code.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never touched.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.docx binary
*.pdf binary
